{"id":8154392002884,"title":"Drop Lampi","handle":"drop-lampi","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop Lampi, which represents the beloved purity of the Finnish nature and the serenity and aesthetics of Lapland, is a beautiful haven of relaxation on your patio. The name Lampi is Finnish and refers to a pond. The still surface of the Lampi pool creates the perfect oasis for relaxing alone or in a larger group. The pool light perfects the mood on dark nights. The surface of the water ripples with sparkles as you unwind after your working day, under the midnight sun or lit by the Northern Lights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e  +\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eContents of the pool package\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u